#: src/terminal.md:15
msgid "Terminal Panel vs Center Terminal"
msgstr ""

#: src/terminal.md:17
msgid "Terminals can open in two locations:"
msgstr ""

#: src/terminal.md:19
msgid ""
"**Terminal Panel** — Docked at the bottom (default), left, or right of the "
"workspace. Toggle with `` Ctrl+` ``."
msgstr ""

#: src/terminal.md:20
msgid ""
"**Center Pane** — Opens as a regular tab alongside your files. Use "
"`workspace: new center terminal` from the command palette."
msgstr ""

#: src/terminal.md:22
msgid "Working with Multiple Terminals"
msgstr ""

#: src/terminal.md:24
msgid ""
"Create additional terminals with `Cmd+N` (macOS) or `Ctrl+N` (Linux/Windows) "
"while focused in the terminal panel. Each terminal appears as a tab in the "
"panel."
msgstr ""

#: src/terminal.md:26
msgid ""
"Split terminals horizontally with `Cmd+D` (macOS) or `Ctrl+Shift+5` (Linux/"
"Windows)."
msgstr ""

